# Path classes of this repository (docs/documentation-rules.md, sections 8 and 9): one
# "<class> <glob>" per line, relative to the repository root; a path takes the highest class
# among the lines that match it and the template's built-in ones. This file belongs to the
# project; a change to it is class approval.

# The product of this repository: every generated project's rules come from here.
approval template/*
approval src/*
approval bin/*

# Secrets.
approval .env
approval .env.*

# Gates: workflows, the template tests, the self-sync, and the harness settings.
gate .github/workflows/*
gate scripts/checks.d/*
gate scripts/sync-self.sh
gate .claude/harness.conf
gate package.json
gate package-lock.json
gate .changeset/config.json
gate scripts/tag-release.sh
